<title>USA: Houston Cty, Ga., schools yield 5.65 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Houston Cty, Ga., schools yield 5.65 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Knox Wall &amp; Co said Tuesday it tentatively priced $34 million Houston County School District, Ga., general obligation bonds at a top yield of 5.65 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>HOUSTON COUNTY SCHOOL DISTRICT (GEORGIA)</p>
<p>RE: $33,950,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>		 A1 (UNDERLYING)</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 03/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 03/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>03/01/1998		  945M    4.00  %	  NRO</p>
<p>03/01/1999		  990M    4.65  %	  NRO</p>
<p>03/01/2000		1,035M    4.625 %	  NRO</p>
<p>03/01/2001		1,085M    4.65  %	  NRO</p>
<p>03/01/2002		1,140M    7.50  %	  NRO</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>03/01/2003		1,200M    7.50  %	  NRO</p>
<p>03/01/2004		1,265M    4.65  %	  NRO</p>
<p>03/01/2005		1,330M    4.75  %	  NRO</p>
<p>03/01/2006		1,405M    4.90  %	  NRO</p>
<p>03/01/2007		1,485M    5.00  %	  NRO</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>03/01/2008		1,570M    5.10  %	  5.20</p>
<p>03/01/2009		1,665M    5.20  %	  5.30</p>
<p>03/01/2010		1,760M    5.30  %	  5.40</p>
<p>03/01/2011		1,865M    5.40  %	  5.50</p>
<p>03/01/2016	     15,210M    5.50  %	  5.65</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 03/01/2003    100.00</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, November 15, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on December 3, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is pending through DTC.</p>
<p>Knox, Wall &amp; Company</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
